    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/5ea9fa5227dbff6a75f4f5ef02fab058.avif?t=1754313756\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our adventures continue. It couldn't have ended that easily, could it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/b99545a713cd67d8313c176224ed1136.poster.avif?t=1754313756\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/b99545a713cd67d8313c176224ed1136.webm?t=1754313756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/b99545a713cd67d8313c176224ed1136.mp4?t=1754313756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got kicked out of the house! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twins so different, but so hot! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/ea5876f5ba26060b4381ece0a9aa52f2.avif?t=1754313756\" width=600 height=338 /></span>The divorced MILF needs your comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/94583f0ae1aa24a213e38da12503213a.avif?t=1754313756\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Your aunt's a real bitch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twins' older sister has completely lost her mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to meet new characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/0637d62d33efcf8872bdcb7b2dd4f241.poster.avif?t=1754313756\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/0637d62d33efcf8872bdcb7b2dd4f241.webm?t=1754313756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/0637d62d33efcf8872bdcb7b2dd4f241.mp4?t=1754313756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>It's time to think about making some dough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/27002591d193b89d1333fa75ad6f768f.avif?t=1754313756\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an executive assistant or an Onlyfucks star?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/29afac48464b8330f37d3f1502aa595a.poster.avif?t=1754313756\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/29afac48464b8330f37d3f1502aa595a.webm?t=1754313756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/29afac48464b8330f37d3f1502aa595a.mp4?t=1754313756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Or maybe it's time to clean up the books at Eva's store. It's gonna take a lot of sweat to get it all straightened out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could possibly go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of things!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your Wishlist and wait for the release. You'll enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692280/extras/5ea9fa5227dbff6a75f4f5ef02fab058.avif?t=1754313756\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p>",
